 is firm with just the slightest wobble in the middle. Leave to cool. Can be kept in the fridge for up to 2 days. Incorporate 3.33 cup mascarpone, 2 whole eggs, 1 zest of 1 lemon, 1 zest of 1 orange, 1.04 cup honey, and 1 to serve fruit mix smoothly until evenly distributed."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Bake Honey Yogurt Cheesecake & Check Doneness"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Bake for 30 minutes until the edges turn golden and set while the center remains tender. Test with a toothpick—if it comes out with a few moist crumbs rather than wet batter, it is ready."}]]}],["$","li","4",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Cool, Garnish & Serve"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"To serve, scatter with almonds, drizzle over the remaining honey, and hand around fresh fruit to go with it. Let Honey Yogurt Cheesecake cool for 10–15 minutes so the crumb sets cleanly before slicing into 6 portions, then garnish and serve."}]]}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","viral-1",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/san-sebastian-basque-burnt-cheesecake/","children":"San Sebastian Basque Burnt Cheesecake"}]}],["$","li","viral-2",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/biscoff-espresso-cloud-tiramisu/","children":"Biscoff Espresso Cloud Tiramisu"}]}],["$","li","viral-7",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/jiggly-japanese-cotton-cheesecake/","children":"Jiggly Japanese Cotton Cheesecake"}]}],["$","li","viral-26",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/crispy-pistachio-ricotta-cannoli-dip/","children":"Crispy Pistachio Ricotta Cannoli Dip"}]}],["$","li","mdb-53543",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/dulce-de-leche-cheesecake-with-a-maria-cookie-crust/","children":"Dulce de Leche Cheesecake with a Maria Cookie Crust."}]}],["$","li","mdb-52858",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/new-york-cheesecake/","children":"New York cheesecake"}]}]]}]]}]}]
